CITA PRODUCTION WEBSITE - KUBERNETES RECOVERY
=============================================

Namespace:

    cita-site-website

Configuration directory:

    /k8s/configs/cita-site-website


1. VALIDATE CONFIGURATION
-------------------------

cd /k8s/configs/cita-site-website

kubectl kustomize . > /tmp/cita-site-website-rendered.yaml

kubectl apply \
    --dry-run=server \
    -f /tmp/cita-site-website-rendered.yaml


2. RE-APPLY CURRENT CONFIGURATION
---------------------------------

If the namespace exists and one or more Kubernetes objects were
accidentally modified or deleted:

cd /k8s/configs/cita-site-website

kubectl apply -k .


3. COMPLETE NAMESPACE RECOVERY
------------------------------

If the entire namespace was accidentally deleted:

kubectl create namespace cita-site-website

cd /k8s/configs/cita-site-website

kubectl apply -k .


4. WATCH RECOVERY
-----------------

kubectl get pods -n cita-site-website -w


5. CHECK DATABASE
-----------------

kubectl rollout status \
    deployment/cita-site-mariadb \
    -n cita-site-website \
    --timeout=120s


6. CHECK WEBSITE
----------------

kubectl rollout status \
    deployment/cita-site-website \
    -n cita-site-website \
    --timeout=120s


7. CHECK PODS
-------------

kubectl get pods \
    -n cita-site-website \
    -o wide


8. CHECK SERVICES
-----------------

