15. IMPORTANT DATA NOTE
-----------------------

The YAML files restore Kubernetes objects and configuration.

They do NOT contain the WordPress files or MariaDB database.

WordPress and MariaDB data reside on NFS-backed persistent volumes.

Do not delete the underlying NFS PVC data when recovering Kubernetes
objects.


16. SECRETS
-----------

The following files contain sensitive data:

    secret-mariadb-root.yaml
    secret-wordpress.yaml
    secret-tls.yaml
    secret-dockerhub.yaml

They must remain readable only by root.

Check with:

    ls -l secret-*.yaml

Expected permissions:

    -rw-------


17. PRODUCTION / STANDBY DIRECTION
----------------------------------

Production:

    Kubernetes cita-site-website

Standby:

    ant.cita.utoronto.ca

Any future synchronization must be:

    Kubernetes production -> ant standby

Do NOT synchronize ant -> Kubernetes unless intentionally performing
a recovery from ant.
